    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join community</h1><p>Feel free to join the community to chat, find a mate, or just contact us directly through any of the following methods:<br><br>For any gameplay guides, you can always check our ongoing wiki at:<br><br>You can also email us at: <a href=\"mailto:steamsupport@burninggalaxy.com\">steamsupport@burninggalaxy.com</a><br>Send us your questions and we'll try to answer them as best we can!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Creation</h2>Players can give free rein to their creativity and imagination in the customizable editor.<br>From scenario layouts, art styles to game modes, create your own levels and challenge the boundaries of your imagination.<br><br>The official scenarios for players to learn from, integrating a large number of art assets, visualization logic, and all kinds of UGC pre-set components, and players can share their work through the marketplace, help each other and edit more imaginative and convenient creation tools.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share</h2>Share the scenarios you created and your experience with other players.<br>Invite/join friends to play and experiment with you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Creation</h2>Players can give free rein to their creativity and imagination in the customizable editor.<br>From scenario layouts, art styles to game modes, create your own levels and challenge the boundaries of your imagination.<br><br>The official scenarios for players to learn from, integrating a large number of art assets, visualization logic, and all kinds of UGC pre-set components, and players can share their work through the marketplace, help each other and edit more imaginative and convenient creation tools.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Share</h2>Share the scenarios you created and your experience with other players.<br>Invite/join friends to play and experiment with you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Discord</h2>",
    "short_description": "Another Earth: Gaming Grid is a delightful virtual world, empowering players to be creators with the tools to expand the universe. In this ever-evolving world, our goal is for players to craft their own stories and meaningful experiences for others.",
